In article <1991Sep7.134107.13223@yang.earlham.edu> irac@yang.earlham.edu writes:
>also how does one kill killer bees?
>I am having trouble getting rid of them and they keep
>on knocking off my character.

I usually run down a corridor a little ways, then turn an fight them when they
can only come at me one at a time (also works for orc hordes).  If I am playing
a Barbarian, Valkyrie, or Samurai, I usually don't have too much trouble killing
them then.  If I have to run, I close a door between me and them to gain some
time.  Sometimes I have to engrave.  When I play a wizard, I engrave quite a
bit.  After you get the hang of it, they are not much problem, and then I can
move on to nastier sorts such as shopkeepers, minotaurs, dragons, liches etc.
Haven't met a minotaur that was a cinch to kill yet.

John


